Usage:
  lightwebpres install [directory] [--lang fr]
  lightwebpres demo [directory] [--lang fr]
  lightwebpres build [directory] [--lang fr] [--output public/]
  lightwebpres check [directory] [--lang fr]
  lightwebpres audit [directory] [--lang fr]
  lightwebpres --help
"""

